# User-defined structural equality predicate for a Point-like type.
# Verifies that user code can implement custom equality semantics
# using field-level Equatable dispatch (= on Int fields).
[
  p1: [x: 1  y: 2]
  p2: [x: 1  y: 2]
  p3: [x: 3  y: 4]
  equal: [fn [a b] [and [= a.x b.x] [= a.y b.y]]]
  same: [equal p1 p2]
  diff: [equal p1 p3]
]

---

%.same
=== out
Bool(true)
